 This install applies to "UFO Enemy Unknow" (c) Microprose.

 This install requires WHDLoad to be in the path. It can be found in the
 WHDLoad package.

 The installed program requires for the
	OCS version	 1 MB ChipMem and 1.5 MB OtherMem
	AGA/CD남 version 1.5 MB ChipMem and 1.5 MB OtherMem

 It can be quit by pressing * (key can be changed with Tooltype "QuitKey=").

 If you have problems with this installation please try and get a newer
 version of this package from the WHDLoad WWW-Page. If that doesn't help try
 some Tooltypes like NOCACHE, NOAUTOVEC, NOVBRMOVE, NOMMU, PAL or NTSC. If
 that also fails, please inform the author via the Bug-Report-Form which
 can be accessed on the WHDLoad WWW-Page.

 The OCS game requires an installed A500 Kickstart 1.3 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick34005.A500". The image can be extracted from a A500 with
 tools like 'GrabKick' or similar which can be found on aminet.
 If the image is of wrong version or altered in any way WHDLoad will quit with
 an appropriate message.
 Additionally the file "kick34005.A500.RTB" must be installed in the same
 directory as the kickstart image. It can be found in the archive
 "util/boot/skick346.lha" on aminet.

 The AGA/CD남 game requires an installed A600/A1200/A4000 Kickstart 3.1 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick40063.A600", "kick40068.A1200" or "kick40068.A4000". The
 image can be extracted from a A600/A1200/A4000 with tools like 'GrabKick' or
 similar which can be found on aminet.
 If the image is of wrong version or altered in any way WHDLoad will quit with
 an appropriate message.
 Additionally the file "kick40063.A600.RTB", "kick40068.A1200.RTB" or
 "kick40068.A4000.RTB" must be installed in the same directory as the kickstart
 image. It can be found in the archive "util/boot/skick346.lha" on aminet.

 For the full WHDLoad package, other installs and updates refer to:
   http://www.whdload.de/
 or   aminet:dev/misc/whdload#?
 and  aminet:game/patch/

 Notes:
 ------
 - first save game creation in the AGA version takes a while because a lot of
   small files will be created, subsequent saves will be faster
   OCS version uses less files, CD남 version uses single file 'nvram'
 - source: https://github.com/wepl/winstalls/tree/master/games/UFO

 version AGA/CD남 1.0 (29.08.2003) done by CFou!
 - CD32&AGA version supported
 - CUSTOM1=1 Tooltype used to skip the intro
 - Load/Save game redirected on HD in 'UFO.nvd' and 'Temp' folders
 - Manual protection of aga version ripped
 - Exotica icon added
 - Manual added
 - Thanks Tony Aknes for original aga version

 version AGA/CD남 1.1 (22.03.2018) done by Wepl
 - slave rewritten
 - uses cpu caches now
 - nonvolatile stuff replaced, saves now to a single file 'nvram', no
   directories required anymore
 - new install script

 version OCS 1.0 (22.03.2018) done by Wepl
 - support for OCS version added
 - SMC fixed
 - aud*vol writes fixed

 version OCS 1.1 (23.09.2026) done by Wepl
 - fixed division by zero which occurred if a turn was finished while no alien
   was left which is able to move, e.g. on the last mission if all aliens are
   killed except the brain (issue #6623)

 version AGA/CD남 1.2 (23.09.2026) done by Wepl
 - rebuilt with current kickemu sources

